 discouraged when that same coach ghosts you.\nUp… down… up… down. Just like a ride.\nBut here’s the thing: you don’t want to end up where you started. And that’s what happens if you’re only riding one recruiting roller coaster.\nThe key is to be on multiple radars.The more coaches who know your name, the better your chances.\nThat’s where I come in. Working with me means getting on the radar of multiple college coaches—not just one or two.\nIf you’re serious about not finishing where you started, have your parents visit my website and complete the financial aid application.\nDon’t waste time. Let’s get moving.\n– Coach Drew","createdAt":"2025-04-16T23:08:37.000Z","createdAtUnix":1744844917,"createdAtLabel":null,"language":"en","conversationId":"1912644328289366444","inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToScreenName":null,"quotedStatusId":null,"retweetTweetId":null,"author":{"handle":"coachdrew94","displayName":"Coach Drew's Recruiting Service - 27 yrs. exp.","avatarUrl":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2117681283660996608/wjkYgCjw_400x400.jpg","profileUrl":"https://x.com/coachdrew94","verified":false,"blueVerified":true,"platformUserId":"1667193117597143040","bio":"If you're a 27' player with 0 offers, still looking, not ready to give up, I can help you find offers. https://t.co/KBP0klXNsL","location":"Serving families nationwide","website":"https://coachdrew93.com/","bannerUrl":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1667193117597143040/1793728987/1500x500","accountCreatedAt":"2023-06-09T15:33:27.000Z","privateAccount":false,"verifiedType":null,"affiliateLabel":null,"professional":null,"metrics":{"availableFields":["followers","following","tweets","favourites","listedCount","mediaCount"],"followers":16335,"following":7408,"tweets":4435,"favourites":15,"listedCount":5,"mediaCount":146}},"metrics":{"availableFields":["likes","retweets","replies","quotes","views","bookmarkCount"],"likes":2,"retweets":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"views":1026,"bookmarkCount":0},"media":[],"expandedUrl":null,"isRetweet":false,"isReply":false,"isQuote":false,"source":null,"communityId":null,"hasAIGeneratedMedia":false,"isPaidPromotion":false,"isTranslatable":false,"hasBirdwatchNotes":false,"possiblySensitive":false,"entities":{"hashtags":[],"userMentions":[],"urls":[],"symbols":[]},"card":null,"poll":null,"article":null,"place":null,"communityNote":null,"isEdited":false,"quotedTweet":null,"retweetedTweet":null},{"id":"1898868428074570065","url":"https://x.com/MRittCGS/status/1898868428074570065","text":"Just saw a price for a package for a private football recruiting service for 1 year…..$4,000\n\n$4,000….\n\n-No NIL Help or advisement \n\n-Said it will make “one personalized graphic” (which you can do for free) \n\n-Camp and Showcase “advisement”\n\n-College Search Tool (can do that on your own) \n\n-“Online Player Profile with your contact info” (Can do that for free with your Twitter account)\n\nParents/High School Football recruits please do your homework during the recruiting process…..don’t waste spending $4,000 on stuff you can do for free","createdAt":"2025-03-09T22:48:07.000Z","createdAtUnix":1741560487,"createdAtLabel":null,"language":"en","conversationId":"1898868428074570065","inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToScreenName":null,"quotedStatusId":null,"retweetTweetId":null,"author":{"handle":"MRittCGS","displayName":"Mike Rittelmann","avatarUrl":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1987621066563272704/QOcY9iQ5_400x400.jpg","profileUrl":"https://x.com/MRittCGS","verified":false,"blueVerified":true,"platformUserId":"1618648482","bio":"Strategic Account Manager | PlayOn Sports / MaxPreps Advantage\n🏈 Director of Scouting & Player Personnel | @CGSAllStar\n🇨🇦 Area Scout | @calstampeders","location":"Pittsburgh, PA","website":"http://cgsallstar.com","bannerUrl":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1618648482/1606853002/1500x500","accountCreatedAt":"2013-07-24T21:35:09.000Z","privateAccount":false,"verifiedType":null,"affiliateLabel":null,"professional":null,"metrics":{"availableFields":["followers","following","tweets","favourites","listedCount","mediaCount"],"followers":23128,"following":11088,"tweets":21553,"favourites":37475,"listedCount":26,"mediaCount":6104}},"metrics":{"availableFields":["likes","retweets","replies","quotes","views","bookmarkCount"],"likes":8,"retweets":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"views":2546,"bookmarkCount":0},"media":[],"expandedUrl":null,"isRetweet":false,"isReply":false,"isQuote":false,"source":null,"communityId":null,"hasAIGeneratedMedia":false,"isPaidPromotion":false,"isTranslatable":false,"hasBirdwatchNotes":false,"possiblySensitive":false,"entities":{"hashtags":[],"userMentions":[],"urls":[],"symbols":[]},"card":null,"poll":null,"article":null,"place":null,"communityNote":null,"isEdited":false,"quotedTweet":null,"retweetedTweet":null},{"id":"1875605123751461015","url":"https://x.com/coachdrew94/status/1875605123751461015","text":"The average coach of my program to the parents after all the financial aid is $725. Of course, some people will pay a little more and some pay as little as $495. If you go to a Perfect Game or Showball, the cost with transportation, logging and food can run as much as $1,500 or more. That’s a one-time event. Usually for 90% of the players it is a waste of money and time. My program goes till either you tell me to stop or when the player goes to college. A one-time fee to have ME contact coaches for your boy. Go to my website. Coach Drew","createdAt":"2025-01-04T18:08:03.000Z","createdAtUnix":1736014083,"createdAtLabel":null,"language":"en","conversationId":"1875605123751461015","inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToScreenName":null,"quotedStatusId":null,"retweetTweetId":null,"author":{"handle":"coachdrew94","displayName":"Coach Drew's Recruiting Service - 27 yrs. exp.","avatarUrl":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2117681283660996608/wjkYgCjw_400x400.jpg","profileUrl":"https://x.com/c