/1788646917267914838","text":"The recruiting process for 95% of the student-athletes competing for recruiting spots is built on the roller coaster concept. You get excited when a coach follows you and you get depressed when he ghosts you. So, you go up and then you go down. Like a roller coaster. To make sure you don't wind up in the same spot as you started, like taking and finishing a ride, you need to make sure you're riding multiple roller coasters. Or be on a lot of college coach's radar. Working with me gets you on a lot of college coach's radar. If you don't want to finish at the same spot you started, have your parents go to my web site and complete the financial aid application. Don't waste time. Coach Drew\nhttps://coachdrew93.com/grant/","createdAt":"2024-05-09T19:07:11.000Z","createdAtUnix":1715281631,"createdAtLabel":null,"language":"en","conversationId":"1788646917267914838","inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToScreenName":null,"quotedStatusId":null,"retweetTweetId":null,"author":{"handle":"coachdrew94","displayName":"Coach Drew's Recruiting Service - 27 yrs. exp.","avatarUrl":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2117681283660996608/wjkYgCjw_400x400.jpg","profileUrl":"https://x.com/coachdrew94","verified":false,"blueVerified":true,"platformUserId":"1667193117597143040","bio":"If you're a 27' player with 0 offers, still looking, not ready to give up, I can help you find offers. https://t.co/KBP0klXNsL","location":"Serving families nationwide","website":"https://coachdrew93.com/","bannerUrl":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1667193117597143040/1793728987/1500x500","accountCreatedAt":"2023-06-09T15:33:27.000Z","privateAccount":false,"verifiedType":null,"affiliateLabel":null,"professional":null,"metrics":{"availableFields":["followers","following","tweets","favourites","listedCount","mediaCount"],"followers":16335,"following":7408,"tweets":4435,"favourites":15,"listedCount":5,"mediaCount":146}},"metrics":{"availableFields":["lik